  Key Differences Summary

  | Aspect           | train_follower       | train_guide_gt         | train_guide       |
  |------------------|----------------------|------------------------|-------------------|
  | Agent Type       | Instruction follower | Expert demonstrator    | Instruction guide |
  | Data Format      | Full episodes        | Expert trajectories    | Full episodes     |
  | Instructions     | ✅ Multi-lingual     | ❌ None               | ✅ Multi-lingual  |
  | Navigation Paths | ✅ Reference paths   | ✅ Expert actions     | ✅ Agent paths    |
  | Structure        | List of episodes     | Dict by instruction ID | List of episodes  |
  | Timing Info      | ✅ Detailed timing    | ❌ None              | ✅ Available      |
  | Total Items      | 58,752 episodes      | 60,300 entries         | 60,300 episodes   |

  Usage in Training
  - train_follower: Train agents to follow navigation instructions
  - train_guide_gt: Train agents to mimic expert navigation patterns
  - train_guide: Train agents to provide navigation guidance
